<title>POLAND: Sokolow sets dividend at PLN 0.06. [CORRECTED 16:00 GMT]</title>
<headline>Sokolow sets dividend at PLN 0.06. [CORRECTED 16:00 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Annually</p>
<p>				Latest (1996)     Prior (1995)</p>
<p> Amount (PLN)		    0.06			none</p>
<p> Pay				 June 26</p>
<p> Record			    May 28</p>
<p>(Corrects Pay date from May 28 to June 26 and Record date from June 26 to May 28.)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name of the Polish meat producer is Sokolowskie Zaklady Miesne SA. It said 1.7 million zlotys from last year's net profit would go toward dividends, 5.8 million to reserves and the rest to summer vacations for employees' children.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
